{"unit_id":"gzsxy__dsh-plugin-skills-manager#feature-1","repo":"gzsxy/dsh-plugin-skills-manager","commit":"687657d732f352d6e05e9aaa2a467a1d36c77aa8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 技能管理台的功能「浏览已安装技能」：扫描本地技能目录并展示技能简介、版本、作者、依赖、文件数量和更新时间。用户打开管理页面即可搜索和筛选这些条目。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:156-180"]}
{"unit_id":"gzsxy__dsh-plugin-skills-manager#feature-2","repo":"gzsxy/dsh-plugin-skills-manager","commit":"687657d732f352d6e05e9aaa2a467a1d36c77aa8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 技能管理台的功能「市场安装」：从 GitHub 仓库或 ClawdHub 下载包含 SKILL.md 的技能并复制到本地技能目录，同时记录来源以便后续更新。用户在市场条目上选择安装或重装。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:372-435"]}
{"unit_id":"gzsxy__dsh-plugin-skills-manager#feature-3","repo":"gzsxy/dsh-plugin-skills-manager","commit":"687657d732f352d6e05e9aaa2a467a1d36c77aa8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 技能管理台的功能「导入本地技能」：枚举 Claude Code、Codex、OpenCode 等目录并复制有效技能到 DSH 技能目录。用户可在导入页面选择来源或指定本机路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:513-564"]}
{"unit_id":"gzsxy__dsh-plugin-skills-manager#feature-4","repo":"gzsxy/dsh-plugin-skills-manager","commit":"687657d732f352d6e05e9aaa2a467a1d36c77aa8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 技能管理台的功能「卸载与恢复」：默认将已卸载技能移入回收站，用户可从管理页面找回；也可选择永久删除。触发方式是在技能卡片选择卸载，或在回收站执行恢复和清除。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:440-500","index.js:992-1004"]}
{"unit_id":"gzsxy__dsh-plugin-skills-manager#feature-5","repo":"gzsxy/dsh-plugin-skills-manager","commit":"687657d732f352d6e05e9aaa2a467a1d36c77aa8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 技能管理台的功能「来源更新检查」：比较绑定来源中的远端技能与本地版本，并列出可更新项目；用户可以手动检查或从技能卡片应用更新。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:738-847"]}
{"unit_id":"gzsxy__dsh-plugin-skills-manager#caveat-1","repo":"gzsxy/dsh-plugin-skills-manager","commit":"687657d732f352d6e05e9aaa2a467a1d36c77aa8","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 技能管理台 使用前须知：英文技能简介自动翻译时会把简介文本发送到 Google 翻译或 MyMemory 的翻译接口；可通过本地翻译表提供中文内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:690-720"]}
